# /settings' Permission mode row: Right is `/permissions <mode>` with its
# notices, twice round (auto -> full access -> ask). Down is counted per binary
# so both land on the row.
wait 2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
fx: key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
xfx: key Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.4
snap marked
key Right
wait 0.8
snap full
home full
key Right
wait 0.8
snap ask
home ask
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
